<title>UK: Telstra Corp sets 1.5 bln French franc 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Telstra Corp sets 1.5 bln French franc 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers J.P. Morgan and Banque Nationale de Paris.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TELSTRA CORP LTD</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FFR   COUPON     6.0 PCT   MATURITY    11.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.686   PAY DATE    11.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.06     SPREAD	+26 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON, PARIS</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS     10-100-1K SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    37.5 BP   SELL CONC  1.625 BP  PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED OCT 2006 AND OCT 2008 CURVE. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
